      "widgets_values": [
        "Create one coherent realistic fashion photograph using all five references with separate roles. <image1> supplies only the man's identity, face and hairstyle. <image2> supplies the light blue denim shirt he must wear. <image3> supplies the rimless glasses he must wear. <image4> supplies the cognac brown leather handbag he must visibly hold by its handle beside his hip. <image5> supplies the lush green forest setting: completely replace the original plain grey studio background with this forest. Frame the man from the head to below the hips so the handbag is fully visible. His hand naturally grips the bag handle. Keep his recognizable face, use consistent natural forest daylight, realistic fabric, glass and leather. Do not retain the grey studio background, do not omit the handbag or glasses, and do not include product-display panels, image grids or text.",
